          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Navuzwa niiva maswa gaveeye mu sigagilung'ani kandi sihayavuguki kuvita ligodo lihakumbirizi, navuzwa liveeye ningwagu, musaalisi alamuviika halovega kulwamadiku saba. ",
          "type": "text",
