          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musaalisi alamuhenzeliza kandi ku lidiku lia saba, kandi niiva halalanda, vulwaye yivwo voveeye vogere; musaalisi alamulandiza kuva mudamanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Navuzwa niiva havundu yaho halavula kugirung'ana, kandi sihalaandaa mba, kandi haniaye, yivwo sivoveeye vulwaye vwo vogere mba. Musaalisi alamulandiza kuva mulahi kolondekana ni miima; kigira haveeye vuzwa imbara kutura kulisambika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.28",
