          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niiva musaalisi amuhenzaa, havundu halwaala yaho ma alole nihayavuguki kuvita ligodo lihakumbirizi, kandi maswa galoleke kuli vuduugi, kandi mangelere, musaalisi alamulandiza kuva mudamanu, kigira keveeye chiyago chu mutwi anoho kukinanwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musaalisi alahenzeliza havundu halwaala zana ku lidiku lia saba, niiva sililandi mba, kandi amaswa gi ligondo liu vuduugi sigaveeye ho kandi sihayavuguki kuvita ligodo lihakumbirizi mba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mundu oyo alavega mutwi gwigwe navuzwa aleke havundu haveeye ningwagu. Ahene yaho musaalisi alamuviika halovega ku madiku gandi saba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lidiku lia saba, musaalisi alamuhenzeliza kandi, na niiva halwaala zana sihalaandi kandi sihayavuguki kuvita ligodo lihakumbirizi, alamulandiza kuva mulahi. Mundu oyo alafuuya zinguvu zizie kandi naye alava mulahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Navuzwa niiva livondo lilalaanda inyima wukulandizwa ndi aveeye mulahi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "musaalisi alamuhenzeliza kandi. Niiva havundu halwaaye yaho hamali kulaanda, sigamuduukira kwenyeleriza maswa ni gaveeye ga mayayi mba; mundu oyo siaveeye mulahi mba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Navuzwa niiva mu lilola liu musaalisi livondo sililandi mba kandi maswa guvulavu gavilukaa hazana, livondo yilio limali kohona, kandi musaalisi alamulandiza kuva mulahi kolondekana ni miima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.37",
