          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundu oveeye novogere kuduuka yiviiki zinguvu zia madali, atasanula liisu lilie mba, afuumi mumoni mwimwe, ma alangilizi, “Mudamanu! Mudamanu!” ",
          "type": "text",
